WEBVTT

00:13:29.004 --> 00:13:31.246
affects how animals live.

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:34.766
And it's not just foie gras,
and it's not just ducks.

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:40.234
We can think about pigs and chickens
and cows in factory farms,

00:13:40.258 --> 00:13:41.416
and we can know.

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:45.388
I can tell you the science is real
that these animals feel, too.

00:13:45.412 --> 00:13:49.932
So every single time
we choose a plant-based meal,

00:13:49.956 --> 00:13:53.693
we are contributing
to reducing animal suffering.

00:13:54.379 --> 00:13:57.270
(Applause)

00:13:57.294 --> 00:14:01.929
So yes, I believe in the reality
of animal grief.